This directory contains the Apache-2.0 Notch CLI core by Driftrail, based on
@freesyntax/notch-cli 0.7.0 / FreeSyntax source commit 37968726, with desktop
session/approval extensions. It is included as source so the shared harness
can be rebuilt without a private repository checkout.

Desktop changes add structured approvals, stable tool-call identities,
agent definition restrictions, lifecycle journaling and a reusable turn API.
The public npm 0.7.0 artifact is a separate, previously verified release.
